            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A computer-implemented inventory monitoring method and an inventory monitoring system. The method includes: capturing an image of a shelf with an image capture unit; detecting and reading shelf label content of a shelf label on the shelf within the image; defining one or more product bounding boxes surrounding one or more corresponding facings of a product within the image; and associating the shelf label content with the one or more product bounding boxes.</p>
            </abstract>
